@startuml
title FE-04 Submit Member Design Request
actor Member
participant DesignRequestController
participant HumanReviewService
participant ImageQualityService
participant DesignSnapshotFacade
database DesignRequestRepository
Member -> DesignRequestController : submit description/images/design reference
DesignRequestController -> HumanReviewService : validate active Member and command
HumanReviewService -> ImageQualityService : validate consent and image quality
ImageQualityService --> HumanReviewService : valid or validation error
HumanReviewService -> DesignSnapshotFacade : copy owned safe design snapshot (optional)
DesignSnapshotFacade --> HumanReviewService : immutable snapshot
HumanReviewService -> DesignRequestRepository : save NEED_REVIEW request
DesignRequestRepository --> HumanReviewService : request version
HumanReviewService --> DesignRequestController : safe request projection
DesignRequestController --> Member : status NEED_REVIEW
note over Member,DesignRequestController
Guest sees the entry but is sent to sign-in.
No AI call, booking, cart or payment is created.
end note
@enduml
